DE0Njc=","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7681467?s=64\u0026u=975aa36c2bf890f0c3f43db7a9d653fd4ad5a5f2\u0026v=4","login":"josepharhar","profileResourcePath":"/josepharhar","__typename":"User","name":"Joey Arhar"},"label":{"id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjg2ODU2ODgw","nameHTML":"select","name":"select","color":"d4c5f9","description":"These are issues that relate to the select component"},"id":"LE_lADOCySmds5iRWQpzwAAAAIVTKmC","intent":null,"__isNode":"LabeledEvent"},"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABh1cxWqgBqjg5NDcyODAyNTg="},{"node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","databaseId":1499336091,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"domenic","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzQ4MQ=="},"id":"I_kwDOCySmds5iRWQp","number":702,"locked":false,"databaseId":1648714793},"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"josepharhar","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7681467?u=975aa36c2bf890f0c3f43db7a9d653fd4ad5a5f2\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/josepharhar","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2ODE0Njc=","name":"Joey Arhar"},"id":"IC_kwDOCySmds5ZXg2b","url":"https://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/702#issuecomment-1499336091","createdAt":"2023-04-06T16:36:30Z","authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Thanks for your feedback! I see what you mean, especially with your details and summary example.\r\n\r\nWhat if we replaced all of the slot and behavior attributes with new elements?\r\n- `\u003cdiv popover=auto slot=listbox behavior=listbox\u003e` would become `\u003clistbox\u003e`\r\n- `\u003cbutton slot=button behavior=button\u003e` would become `\u003cselectmenubutton\u003e` or something. I don't think we can necessarily just use `\u003cbutton\u003e` because you might want to use `\u003cbutton\u003e` elements in other parts of the selectmenu.\r\n- `\u003cspan slot=selected-value behavior=selected-value\u003e` would become `\u003cselectedvalue\u003e`\r\n- `\u003cspan slot=marker behavior=marker\u003e` would become `\u003cmarker\u003e`, or maybe we could replace it entirely with a pseudo-element...?\r\n\r\nThis would align better with the HTML spec, but may also reduce the customizability of selectmenu, for example by not providing a way to opt out of behaviors - not sure how important this actually is for customizability though.\r\n\r\nI'm likely missing historical context on this. I'd like to talk about it at the next meeting","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThanks for your feedback! I see what you mean, especially with your details and summary example.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eWhat if we replaced all of the slot and behavior attributes with new elements?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;div popover=auto slot=listbox behavior=listbox\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e would become \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;listbox\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;button slot=button behavior=button\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e would become \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;selectmenubutton\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e or something. I don't think we can necessarily just use \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;button\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e because you might want to use \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;button\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e elements in other parts of the selectmenu.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;span slot=selected-value behavior=selected-value\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e would become \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;selectedvalue\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;span slot=marker behavior=marker\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e would become \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u0026lt;marker\u0026gt;\u003c/code\u003e, or maybe we could replace it entirely with a pseudo-element...?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThis would align better with the HTML spec, but may also reduce the customizability of selectmenu, for example by not providing a way to opt out of behaviors - not sure how important this actually is for customizability though.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eI'm likely missing historical context on this. I'd like to talk about it at the next meeting\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"79cac43b203061bd413be203cf6508f86a14b3c18f1b1bfca577e177679ab74b","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxODY5NTEyODY=","name":"open-ui","owner":{"__typename":"Organization","id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc5OTYwOTcx","login":"openui","url":"https://github.com/openui"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"openui/open-ui","databaseId":186951286},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":1,"nodes":[{"__typename":"User","login":"xiaochengh","__isNode":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mzg0MTU1"}]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{